category: Text
build-depends: cygport libbenchmark-devel libgtest-devel libmarisa-devel rapidjson-devel
sdesc: "Conversion between Traditional and Simplified Chinese (utilities)"
ldesc: "Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC) is an opensource project for conversion between
Traditional Chinese and Simplified Chinese, supporting character-level
conversion, phrase-level conversion, variant conversion and regional idioms
among Mainland China, Taiwan and Hong kong."
